data_MERGE_GROUND
#
# Ground-state member of the merge-states fixture pair.
#
# Polymer chain A: ALA 1 (blank altloc), SER 2 (two conformers A/B), GLY 3 (blank
# altloc). Non-polymer: EDO at auth_seq_id 101, which collides with the changed
# member's non-polymer number. EDO is present here and absent from the changed
# member.
#
# label_asym_id B / label_entity_id 2 mean EDO *here* and W2S in the changed
# member: the same label identity naming different components in the two inputs
# is the corruption this command's Structure-level assembly exists to avoid.
#
_entry.id MERGE_GROUND
#
_cell.entry_id MERGE_GROUND
_cell.length_a 30.000
_cell.length_b 40.000
_cell.length_c 50.000
_cell.angle_alpha 90.00
_cell.angle_beta 90.00
_cell.angle_gamma 90.00
#
_symmetry.entry_id MERGE_GROUND
_symmetry.space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
#
loop_
_chem_comp.id
_chem_comp.formula
ALA 'C3 H7 N O2'
SER 'C3 H7 N O3'
GLY 'C2 H5 N O2'
EDO 'C2 H6 O2'
#
loop_
_atom_site.group_PDB
_atom_site.id
_atom_site.type_symbol
_atom_site.label_atom_id
_atom_site.label_alt_id
_atom_site.label_comp_id
_atom_site.label_asym_id
_atom_site.label_entity_id
_atom_site.label_seq_id
